PR fixes an issue where tooltips could render partially off-screen near\r\nthe right or bottom edges of the viewport.\r\n\r\n### Changes\r\n- Updated `Viewport::_gui_show_tooltip_at` in `scene/main/viewport.cpp`.\r\n- Tooltips are first positioned offset from the cursor.\r\n- If they would overflow the viewport, they are flipped to the opposite side (left/above).\r\n- If flipping still fails, tooltips are clamped inside the viewport edges.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\n- Verified tooltip behavior at different Editor Display Scales (0.75×, 1.0×, 1.5×, 2.0×).\r\n- Tested on Windows with display scaling at 125% and 150%.\r\n- Tooltips remain fully visible and no longer overlap the mouse cursor.\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n- Tooltips sometimes went off-screen or covered the cursor.\r\n\r\n### After\r\n- Tooltips now offset correctly, flip when needed, and clamp as fallback.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_ur